OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly dry
OL,6,Fevening, with clear spells. Further
OL,7,Foccasionally heavy rain passes through
OL,8,Fin the early hours, clearing around
OL,9,Fdawn, followed by clearer spells.
OL,10,FStrong and gusty winds throughout.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA brighter day with some
OL,13,Fsunny spells, these mixed with
OL,14,Fisolated blustery showers, some of
OL,15,Fwhich could be heavy. Winds easing a
OL,16,Flittle later in the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
