OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells Wednesday, with occasional
OL,7,Fshowers. Winds falling light. Fog
OL,8,Fpatches Thursday and Friday mornings,
OL,9,Fwith sunny spells later. Temperatures
OL,10,Fnear average.
